# Brandfetch API key — required by the `client-theming/brandfetch` module.
#
# How to get one:
#   1. Create a free account at https://brandfetch.com (or https://developers.brandfetch.com).
#   2. Open the Developers dashboard and create an application/API key.
#   3. Copy the API key (used as a Bearer token for the Brand & Search APIs).
#   4. Paste it below and keep this file OUT of version control (.env is gitignored).
#
# Docs: https://docs.brandfetch.com/reference/brand-api
#
# NOTE: This is a private, billable credential. Only use it server-side
# (API routes, scripts, backend). Never expose it to the browser or commit it.
BRANDFETCH_API_KEY=your_brandfetch_api_key_here
